}
|
}}}
leanPoo: "LeanPoo foundation\nObject algorithms / C4 / caches\nTypes / Contracts / proof reuse"
cedar: "Upstream Cedar semantics\nEvaluation and typechecking\nOfficial Lean specification"
model: "Shared Cedar model\nComposable typed Components\nSee the component inventory"
zeroTrust: "Zero Trust Component\nContinuous-use requirements\nConditions / obligations / refinement"
verticalControls: "Vertical controls\nHealthcare / financial services\nSee each implemented vertical"
platformProjections: "Platform projections\nAWS AgentCore / Google SDP\nOptional profile bindings"
production: "Production profiles\nIndependent composed exports\nShared Backend architecture contract"
examples: "Example Cases\nScenario facts and assumptions\nCatalog exports / conformance inputs"
rust: "Rust consumers\nStrict SDK validation / replay\nShared crates and Host adapters"
host: "Downstream Host\nAuthenticates facts / enforces effects\nDurability and runtime providers"
leanPoo -> model: Object and proof APIs
cedar -> model: Cedar semantic authority
model -> zeroTrust: Exposes a model Component
model -> verticalControls: Shared capability composition
model -> platformProjections: Platform-specific projection
model -> production: Compose selected Components
model -> examples: Compose scenario controls
zeroTrust -> production: Selected use requirements
zeroTrust -> examples: Selected use requirements
verticalControls -> production: Selected industry controls
platformProjections -> production: Optional platform binding
production -> rust: Versioned profile exports
examples -> rust: Scenario replay inputs
rust -> host: Admitted receipts and adapters
